      {
        "day": 46,
        "vid": "luis_fernandez",
        "kcal": 420,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Luis — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Luis doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
      {
        "day": 63,
        "vid": "omar_farouk",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ Half your share tonight. You hand the rest to Omar, who takes it with both hands and doesn't say a word until it's gone."
      },
      {
        "day": 111,
        "vid": "aria_thompson",
        "kcal": 1184,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Aria — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Aria doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
      {
        "day": 112,
        "vid": "aria_thompson",
        "kcal": 1100,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Aria looks it. You set your second half in front of Aria. 'Eat,' you say. Aria eats like someone making up for days."
      },
      {
        "day": 113,
        "vid": "dmitri_sokolov",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ Half your share tonight. You hand the rest to Dmitri, who takes it with both hands and doesn't say a word until it's gone."
      },
      {
        "day": 114,
        "vid": "aria_thompson",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ You wave off the second scoop and nod toward Aria. 'Aria eats first tonight.' Nobody at the fire disagrees."
      },
      {
        "day": 120,
        "vid": "dmitri_sokolov",
        "kcal": 1200,
        "line": "🍽️ Thin day. Your bowl stays half-full — the other half goes to Dmitri, who's been quiet about being hungry."
      },
